{
  "note": "Tone presets for OFX 0.90.12/0.90.13. Stops are log2 relative to linear 0.18 after Exposure/balance. The shoulder works on the RGB mean, the toe on the darkest channel. The first preset is the plugin default. Tuned offline (cine_proto) on 4 frames through the repo Kodak_2383_D65 LUT toward Silbersalz35 graded targets: top about 195-215/255, black about 15-25/255, mid tones held, no clipping. 0.90.13 adds highlight and shadow desaturation toward Rec709 luminance and a luminance-preserving warm cream tint in the highlights, weighted by the same RGB-mean stops.",
  "controls": [
    {
      "key": "shoulder_on",
      "label": "Highlight shoulder",
      "kind": "Boolean",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 1,
      "step": 1
